Package: claude-usage-monitor
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0
Maintainer: Claude Usage Monitor <noreply@example.com>
Description: Claude Code API usage monitor for GNOME panel
 Shows Claude Code subscription usage limits (5-hour and 7-day windows)
 as color-coded progress bars on the GNOME top panel.
 Features burn-rate coloring, time-elapsed indicator, dragging, and resizing.
Installed-Size: 2528
